      "text": "Sellers must clearly and conspicuously disclose their refund, return, or cancellation policy to buyers before the transaction.",
      "quote": "It is unfair and deceptive trade practice: (a) To fail to clearly and conspicuously disclose to a buyer, prior to the consummation of a transaction, the exact nature and extent of the seller's refund, return, or cancellation policy;",
